      "score": 95,
      "summary": "B provides an especially coherent exception-first command band, strong table triage hierarchy, explicit semantic statuses and actions, and useful surface normalization through a defined spacing rhythm and reduced elevation. It is slightly incomplete because the fragmented page command area, long product-name behavior, oversized chart, and full production-state contract are not directly resolved in the redesign moves."
