      "score": 99,
      "summary": "C most completely translates the product authority into a lead-summary, priority-metric, exception-queue, then diagnostics sequence. It combines product-specific anti-generic judgment with precise typography, contrast, spacing, elevation, semantic-color, table-scan, chart-purpose, long-content, and state-resilience corrections. Its acceptance criteria are comprehensive, with only minor looseness where a first-viewport lead summary could substitute for visible table rows and where accessible names are allowed as an alternative to visible row-action labels."
