      "summary": "A correctly makes the exception queue primary, demotes lower-value metrics, replaces ambiguous status and action treatments, and remains rigorously grounded in static evidence. Its main weakness is incomplete visual-craft follow-through: inconsistent spacing, excessive borders and shadows, low-contrast typography, and the oversized chart are identified but not all receive implementation-ready corrections or acceptance criteria."
